      "message": "FreeType ignores the CidCount operator and computes the glyph count for a bare CFF CID-keyed font using the max valid CID from the charset. We could do the same here with something like `let cid_count \u003d charset.iter().filter(|(gid, cid)| gid.to_u32() \u003c charstrings.len()).map(|(_, cid)| cid.to_u16()).max().unwrap_or(0) as u32 + 1;`",
